+## CLI usage
+
+```bash
+# Single image query
+python -m llava.serve.cli \
+    --model-path liuhaotian/llava-v1.5-7b \
+    --image-file image.jpg \
+    --query "What is in this image?"
+
+# Multi-turn conversation
+python -m llava.serve.cli \
+    --model-path liuhaotian/llava-v1.5-7b \
+    --image-file image.jpg
+# Then type questions interactively
+```
+
+## Web UI (Gradio)
+
+```bash
